  "goodToKnow": "Die Knechtschaft is servitude or bondage: in Knechtschaft leben, sich aus der Knechtschaft befreien. Der Knecht was a farmhand or servant; Knecht Ruprecht is Saint Nicholas's dark companion. Knechten means to oppress. The 1525 Peasants' War (Bauernkrieg) was a revolt against feudal oppression. Synonyms: die Unterdrückung, die Leibeigenschaft (serfdom). It has no plural."
